{'symbol': 'BLL', 'date': '2021-07-15 04:05:00', 'title': 'BALL INTENDS TO BUILD NEW ALUMINUM BEVERAGE PACKAGING PLANTS IN UK & RUSSIA, SUPPORTING THE LONG TERM GROWTH OF OUR STRATEGIC PARTNERS.', 'text': "BROOMFIELD, COLO., JULY 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BALL CORPORATION (NYSE: BLL), ONE OF THE WORLD'S LEADING MANUFACTURERS OF INFINITELY RECYCLABLE ALUMINIUM BEVERAGE PACKAGING, IS PLANNING TO SIGNIFICANTLY INCREASE ITS MANUFACTURING CAPACITY, WITH NEW CUTTING-EDGE FACILITIES IN THE UK AND RUSSIA."}